```plaintext
CONNECT: ["CONNECT <<VALUE>>\r\n","ClientId: <<VALUE>>\r\n","CleanSession: <<VALUE>>\r\n","KeepAlive: <<VALUE>>\r\n","WillTopic: <<VALUE>>\r\n","WillMessage: <<VALUE>>\r\n","Username: <<VALUE>>\r\n","Password: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

CONNACK: ["CONNACK <<VALUE>>\r\n","SessionPresent: <<VALUE>>\r\n","ReturnCode: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

SUBSCRIBE: ["SUBSCRIBE <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n","TopicFilter: <<VALUE>>\r\n","QoS: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

SUBACK: ["SUBACK <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n","ReturnCodes: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

PUBLISH: ["PUBLISH <<VALUE>>\r\n","TopicName: <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n","Payload: <<VALUE>>\r\n","QoS: <<VALUE>>\r\n","Dup: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

PUBACK: ["PUBACK <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

PUBREC: ["PUBREC <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

PUBREL: ["PUBREL <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

PUBCOMP: ["PUBCOMP <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

UNSUBSCRIBE: ["UNSUBSCRIBE <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n","TopicFilter: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

UNSUBACK: ["UNSUBACK <<VALUE>>\r\n","PacketId: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]

DISCONNECT: ["DISCONNECT <<VALUE>>\r\n","ReasonCode: <<VALUE>>\r\n"]
```

### Notes:
- Each message type includes placeholders (`<<VALUE>>`) to indicate where specific values should be inserted.
- The `CONNECT` message includes options for `Will` messages, `Username`, and `Password` for authentication.
- The `SUBSCRIBE` and `UNSUBSCRIBE` messages include `TopicFilter` and `PacketId` for identifying the requests.
- The `PUBLISH` message includes options for `QoS`, `Dup` (duplicate delivery), and `Payload`.
- The `PUBACK`, `PUBREC`, `PUBREL`, and `PUBCOMP` messages are used for QoS 1 and 2 acknowledgments.
- The `DISCONNECT` message can include a `ReasonCode` to indicate why the client is disconnecting.
